      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "During course therapy with nonachlazine of patients with ischemic heart disease, stable angina pectoris a negative inotropic effect of the drug in persons with eukinetic and in particular hyperkinetic type of hemodynamics was revealed. Enhancement of beta-adrenoblocking effect of nonachlazine with an increase of its daily dose was found. Nonachlazine effect on hemodynamic parameters was shown to be mediated through adrenoreactive structures."},
